"                                                clinic operator, compounding pharmacy, or\n"
"                                                pharmaceutical distributor. We verify this before\n"
"                                                processing orders."
msgstr "Para realizar un pedido, usted debe operar en una\n"
"                                                capacidad profesional, como medico autorizado,\n"
"                                                operador de clinica, farmacia de formulacion o\n"
"                                                distribuidor farmaceutico. Verificamos esto antes de\n"
"                                                procesar pedidos."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_legal_compliance_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
"Using products in compliance with all applicable\n"
"                                                    local, state, and federal regulations."
msgstr "Uso de productos en cumplimiento de todas las regulaciones\n"
"                                                    locales, estatales y federales aplicables."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_legal_compliance_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
"Verifying that each product is legal to import,\n"
"                                                    compound, dispense, or distribute in your\n"
"                                                    jurisdiction."
msgstr "Verificar que cada producto sea legal para importar,\n"
"                                                    formular, dispensar o distribuir en su\n"
"                                                    jurisdiccion."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_privacy_policy_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
"We have adopted this Privacy Policy, which determines how we are processing "
"the information collected by BioElevate, which also provides the reasons why"
" we must collect certain personal data about you. Therefore, you must read "
"this Privacy Policy before using BioElevate website."
msgstr "Hemos adoptado esta Politica de Privacidad, que determina como procesamos la informacion recopilada por BioElevate y que tambien proporciona las razones por las que debemos recopilar ciertos datos personales sobre usted. Por lo tanto, debe leer esta Politica de Privacidad antes de usar el sitio web de BioElevate."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_privacy_policy_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
"We secure information you provide on computer servers in a controlled, "
"secure environment, protected from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure. "
"We keep reasonable administrative, technical, and physical safeguards to "
"protect against unauthorized access, use, modification, and personal data "
"disclosure in its control and custody. However, no data transmission over "
"the Internet or wireless network can be guaranteed."
msgstr "Protegemos la informacion que usted proporciona en servidores informaticos en un entorno controlado y seguro, protegido contra acceso, uso o divulgacion no autorizados. Mantenemos salvaguardas administrativas, tecnicas y fisicas razonables para proteger contra el acceso no autorizado, uso, modificacion y divulgacion de datos personales bajo su control y custodia. Sin embargo, no se puede garantizar ninguna transmision de datos por Internet o red inalambrica."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bioelevate.theme_homepage_content
msgid ""
"We supply peptide products\n"
"                                        exclusively to licensed medical professionals and qualified\n"
"                                        distributors. Every product leaves our facility with\n"
"                                        verified purity data, cold-chain packaging, and full\n"
"                                        documentation."
msgstr "Suministramos productos peptidicos\n"
"                                        exclusivamente a profesionales medicos autorizados y distribuidores\n"
"                                        calificados. Cada producto sale de nuestras instalaciones con\n"
"                                        datos de pureza verificados, empaque de cadena de frio y documentacion\n"
"                                        completa."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_privacy_policy_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
"We take care of your personal data and undertake to guarantee its "
"confidentiality and security."
msgstr "Cuidamos sus datos personales y nos comprometemos a garantizar su confidencialidad y seguridad."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_privacy_policy_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
"We will disclose any information we collect, use or receive if required or "
"permitted by law, such as to comply with a subpoena or similar legal "
"process, and when we believe in good faith that disclosure is necessary to "
"protect our rights, protect your safety or the safety of others, investigate"
" fraud, or respond to a government request."
msgstr "Divulgaremos cualquier informacion que recopilemos, usemos o recibamos si la ley lo exige o permite, como para cumplir con una citacion u otro proceso legal similar, y cuando creamos de buena fe que la divulgacion es necesaria para proteger nuestros derechos, proteger su seguridad o la de otros, investigar fraude o responder a una solicitud gubernamental."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_bioelevate.theme_homepage_content
msgid ""
"We'll get back to you\n"
"                                                within 1 business day."
msgstr "Le responderemos\n"
"                                                dentro de 1 dia habil."

#. module: theme_bioelevate
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:theme_bioelevate.page_legal_compliance_ir_ui_view
msgid ""
